        <h1>Debug your RTL <span class="em">without the headache</span>.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Riptide is a waveform debugger for the 21st century. Designed from the ground up to give you the tools you need to find bugs quickly while minimizing visual noise. GPU accelerated rendering, advanced querying, derived signal expressions, and direct simulator control.</p>
